menu "Front door"

config FRONT_DOOR_LAUNCH_URL
    string "Where the device's address sends a browser"
    default "https://k7.xperiments.dev/#/player"
    help
        The device serves no page of its own (ADR 0067), so its address is a doorbell:
        GET / answers 302 to this URL. A development build points it at the development
        origin, for example https://k7-dev.xperiments.dev:8000/#/player.

endmenu
